# angular adapter manifest — the DATA fields of the Angular StackAdapter.
# Code fields (detect/install/discover/probe/run/coverage) stay in
# src/adapters/angular/index.ts; auditRules stays TS (jsAuditRules).
# Declared fields override via manifestFields. Partial by design.
# guidance/patterns are kind-independent — both unit and e2e blocks are the SAME
# text, reproducing the TS's kind-agnostic behavior byte-for-byte.

adapter angular
  command typecheck = npx tsc --noEmit
  command lint = true
  command test-unit = npx jest
  command test-e2e = true
  command coverage = npx jest --coverage
  patterns unit = angular-unit-patterns.md
  patterns e2e = angular-unit-patterns.md
  guidance unit:
    (Angular + jest-preset-angular) place the test next to its source as <name>.spec.ts. Use TestBed for components/services. `import { describe, it, expect } from '@jest/globals'` is implicit; assert concrete values + error paths. Use ONLY the class/exports in the ground truth.
  guidance e2e:
    (Angular + jest-preset-angular) place the test next to its source as <name>.spec.ts. Use TestBed for components/services. `import { describe, it, expect } from '@jest/globals'` is implicit; assert concrete values + error paths. Use ONLY the class/exports in the ground truth.
